  "type": "text",
  "subjects": [],
  "content": [
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "4:58 PM",
      "text": "I have a good scoop for you"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "5:00 PM",
      "text": "Oooh"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "5:07 PM",
      "text": "They’re having some sort of pride night"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "5:07 PM",
      "text": "No wayyyyuu"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "5:07 PM",
      "text": "Ahahahaha"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "5:07 PM",
      "text": "When is it?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "5:08 PM",
      "text": "I don’t know, but they’re announcing the date on July 10"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "5:09 PM",
      "text": "Is it like an official pride event? This year?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "5:10 PM",
      "text": "It’s called a Pride Pack and I know they aren’t changing logo colors, announcing in a press release, advertising on TV or radio and making it a big deal. I honestly think they’re making a ticket package to capitalize on LGBT people"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "5:13 PM",
      "text": "Lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "5:13 PM",
      "text": "Way to go halfway"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "5:13 PM",
      "text": "That’s the Tigers motto!"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "5:16 PM",
      "text": "Anyway, that’s something that’s happening, so if I get more details or you find someone else who confirms it, beat Tony"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "5:17 PM",
      "text": "Yep"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "5:18 PM",
      "text": "You da man. Oh he would be SO pissed"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "5:21 PM",
      "text": "I’d pay good money to witness his reaction when that news breaks"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "5:23 PM",
      "text": "I can’t stop giggling. I’m so giddy"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "5:38 PM",
      "text": "Also, we’ll talk more if you’re at the ballpark this weekend, but I got the job at the zoo."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "5:42 PM",
      "text": "Nice!"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "5:42 PM",
      "text": "Ok yeah"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:56 PM",
      "text": "https://twitter.com/georgesipple/status/1015036135809175553?ref_src=twcamp%5Eshare%7Ctwsrc%5Eios%7Ctwgr%5Ecom.apple.UIKit.activity.Message%7Ctwcon%5E7100%7Ctwterm%5E0"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:56 PM",
      "text": "Just making sure you saw this fine piece of photography"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:56 PM",
      "text": "Worth a RT"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "10:12 PM",
      "text": "Laughed at “Worth a RT”"
    }
  ]
